// planner: work estimate (sorted schedule, CUDA bucketing): the window size of sources.e1 (X.in), two binary searches
// planner: CUDA heavy kernel: no root checks; the lanes stride over the scan of sources and each runs every stage nested in its own bindings; lane bin counts are summed across the warp
